# Runtime-uploaded course materials — these were accidentally committed at some point, which
# masked a real bug: they only kept "working" across Render redeploys because they got
# recreated fresh from git on every deploy, while genuinely runtime-uploaded files (never
# committed) were silently lost. The real fix is Supabase Storage (see materials.py); this
# directory should never hold the only copy of anything.
backend/data/uploads/
